s/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:183:## Task 2: macOS voice resolution + Samantha fallback\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:195:# Voice resolution: premium voices may be missing; we match + fall back.\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:219:def test_resolve_voice_falls_back_to_samantha(monkeypatch, capsys):\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:223:    assert \"Falling back to Samantha\" in capsys.readouterr().out\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:263:    requested voice isn't installed, fall back to the always-present default\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:277:        f'Falling back to {DEFAULT_VOICE}.'\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:310:git commit --only video_claw/tts/macos.py tests/test_say_tts.py -m \"feat(tts): resolve macOS voice by substring, fall back to Samantha\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:487:def test_resolve_avatar_falls_back_to_bundled(tmp_path):\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:542:Unlike `lipsync.py` (which animates a headshot via paid fal.ai), this module\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:557:# Bundled fallback portrait (Becky), shipped inside the package.\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:829:               auto_yes: bool = False,\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:830:               skip_preview: bool = False,\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:846:               auto_yes: bool = False,\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:847:               skip_preview: bool = False,\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:1057:- **macOS `say` TTS** (offline; default voice `\"Zoe (Premium)\"`, falling back\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:1059:- **No fal.ai lip-sync** — any slide `lipsync: True` is ignored.\n./docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-29-free-mode.md:1111:Expected: no ElevenLabs/fal/Deepgram calls; console shows `[boot] $0 m